### Responses API (Primary Caesura wrapper)
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "Hello, I need help with my account",
  "conversationId": "demo-session-1"
}

###

### Streaming Responses API
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/responses/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "Can you explain your pricing?",
  "conversationId": "demo-session-1"
}

###

### Chat Completions
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5.4-mini",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello, I need help with my account"}],
  "user": "demo-session-2"
}

###

### Streaming Chat Completions
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5.4-mini",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Can you explain your pricing?"}],
  "stream": true,
  "user": "demo-session-2"
}

###
